# Non-parameterized function type alias in expr form: [Fn@Integer [Integer Integer]].
# Equivalent to test_fn_type_concrete but uses the same source as the Rust test.
# The lambda takes two Integer params and returns the first.
[
  Addable: [type [Fn@Integer [Integer Integer]]]
  add: [@Addable [fn [let a@Integer b@Integer] a]]
  result: [add 10 20]
]
=== out
["Addable": ["Fn": Addable.Fn  "Integer": Addable.Integer]  "add": [fn [let a b] ...]  "result": 10]
